{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"事情过去了 身体还不信\",\"source\":\"事情表面上仿佛已经过去，身体和情绪却还没有完全相信一切已经结束。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把“表面上仿佛已经过去”的不确定表象写成了事情确已过去。\"},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"screen\":\"想起从前那些亲近的时光\",\"source\":\"想起曾被当作自己人\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把具体的被当作自己人的归属感泛化成普通的亲近时光。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"舍不得以前的生活\",\"source\":\"舍不得被当作自己人的日子\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把具体怀念的被接纳感泛化成整个过去的生活。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"只想在难受的时候有人陪着\",\"source\":\"怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"把害怕孤单到可能再次忍受旧委屈，改成单纯想在难受时有人陪，改变了他对回头动机的表达。\"},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"screen\":\"想到往后还会孤单\",\"source\":\"他又怕还要等很久，才能再遇上那样亲近的人\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把担心还要等很久的可能性，写成了认定往后还会孤单。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9cf242c5-ef39-490a-826f-eccaf1c2b062", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T165524008262Z", "elapsed_seconds": 237.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T16:59:21.616796+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9cabfb18567029fb5f751a9d83a3d86afd667e0b2c780e566cf6906e674b3146", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automa